WEBVTT

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.730
Victory is ours.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.820
The magic engine dynamo
has stopped moving.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.820
It's no good! The main
cannon can't be fired!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.200
This is a disaster!

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:26.130
All ships, alter course sixteen points, in succession,

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.840
preserving order of the fleet.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:28.800
No!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:31.090
It's not over yet!

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.550
It's not over. Not this war...

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:35.930
Not myself!

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:37.890
Mio!

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.560
I will board the Yamato

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.930
and start the magic engine
dynamo with my magic power!

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.060
Mio, no!

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.020
Sakamoto-san!

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.540
Do you have a death wish,
Major Sakamoto?!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.330
No, Major! Don't go!

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:31.420
It's too dangerous!

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.290
Sakamoto-san!

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.960
It's impossible! You don't
have much magic power left!

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:39.180
So you know about that, Miyafuji.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:43.810
It's true. I've only got enough magic power now to fly.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.770
Knowing that, head back!

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:49.100
Minna.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.100
Head back, Major.

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:55.530
If I don't go, who will
start the Yamato's engine?

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.320
How ironic...

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.370
That I, the one person
who couldn't even fight,

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:05.370
am the only one left with
the magic power to do this.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.250
Major...

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:10.000
Minna, I'm glad.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.790
After all that's happened to me, there's still something I can do.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.800
I can be part of the 501st.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.800
I can be one of the eleven.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.300
Mio.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.100
Major...

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:30.640
Please... Promise to come back alive.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.650
That's an order.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.150
Understood.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:42.990
Major!

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:44.820
Sakamoto-san, no!

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.910
Yoshika-chan, where are you going?

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:49.910
Wait!

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.210
Yoshika-chan!

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:55.880
Lynne-chan, let me go!

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:01.970
You can't go! You used up all
your magic power in battle, too!

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.970
But Sakamoto-san... She's...

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.470
It's too late. Let her go, Miyafuji.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.850
You can't reach her in time anyway.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:15.560
But... But!

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:16.610
Yoshika-chan...

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.530
<i>Forgive me, Miyafuji.</i>

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:24.110
<i>At the end of the day, I am a warrior, existing solely for battle.</i>

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:28.370
<i>This is the only way I know how to live!</i>

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.040
Violet Lightning Mk II, I just need one thing from you!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.540
Get me to the Yamato!

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:49.510
The magic engine dynamo responded.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.890
Was it Major Sakamoto's doing?

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:07.070
Magic engine dynamo is operational. Power output is rising.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:08.990
She did it, Captain.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.580
I see.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:14.960
But we cannot control
it from here remotely.

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:20.210
<i>Major Sakamoto, you're our only hope.</i>

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.470
That's it. More... More!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:38.770
I see. So you need me, too.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:42.730
All right. Let's do this, Yamato!

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:47.780
Output at 80%. Thirty seconds until Neuroification reverses.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.030
Mio...

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.290
Sakamoto-san.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.500
Output at 90%.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.250
This is how a warrior lives!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.380
Critical output reached.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:04.210
Fire!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:36.700
The Neuroi's signal is gone.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.750
And Sakamoto-san?

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:39.670
Major.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:47.470
Even protected in the Yamato,
an explosion like that would be...

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:49.720
Mio.

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.350
The radar's picking up the Yamato!

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:57.430
Well, I'll be... It survived the blast!

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.730
Sakamoto-san!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:03.690
She did it!

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.650
If the Yamato survived,
that means she did, too.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:10.360
You did it, Major.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.450
We won!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:14.160
Thank goodness...

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.040
Something isn't right.
It's still Neuroified.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.040
What?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:27.090
How can that be? It should
have reverted by now!

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.420
The Neuroi's signal has returned.

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.300
What?!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:38.890
What's that?

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.850
No way. That couldn't be...

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.230
I've never seen a core that big!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:01.910
The Neuroi are counterattacking.

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.580
All ships, retreat!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.960
The battleship was blasted!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.210
Such incredible force!

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:08.840
Th-That's...

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.180
Sakamoto-san!

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:18.470
Major!

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:21.390
Rescue the Major. Fire main cannons!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:29.280
The shells we fired stopped,
just short of hitting the Neuroi.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.570
Wh-What?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.990
It's a shield.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.450
The Neuroi put up a shield!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:34.990
No way.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.910
That shield...

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.450
That's a Fuso shield!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:40.370
It's obvious what's happening.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:43.830
The Neuroi are using the Major's magic power!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.540
Captain, we cannot attack properly.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:51.210
I never thought I'd see
the Neuroi using a shield.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:56.050
As it stands, we're done.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.180
This can't be.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.350
The "True Reppuzan."

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:03.930
It's a secret technique passed down

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.060
in the Fuso Empire
since time immemorial.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.400
If I'm able to master it,

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:12.360
I'll be able to obliterate even the strongest Neuroi in one strike.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.450
True Reppuzan...

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.750
Littorio sunk!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.750
Ready the anti-air shells!

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.630
All non-combat personnel, move inside!

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:28.170
Is anyone hurt?

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.380
At this rate, we're done for!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.960
Is there anything we can do?

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:33.760
There isn't.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:38.260
We used up all our magic
power and can't even fly now.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:42.430
Yoshika-chan?

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:56.990
So this is how it all ends.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:03.120
Captain, someone's using
the central elevator!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:03.620
What?

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:23.890
<i>Sakamoto-san!</i>

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.360
Yoshika-chan!

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.990
What are you doing, Miyafuji?

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.240
Miyafuji-san? What are you...

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.740
What are you doing, Miyafuji-san?

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.250
I'm going to save Sakamoto-san!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:47.790
That's impossible!

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.460
You're out of magic power, too.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.840
Even if you can fly,
you can't defeat the Neuroi.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:54.630
I can!

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.590
Using the True Reppuzan!

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.340
True Reppuzan?

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:01.800
Th-That's the Major's attack!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:04.100
And the Reppumaru is gone.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.220
It still exists... Up there.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:12.810
That's...

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.900
Reppumaru?

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.150
All the way up there?

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:19.320
Huh?

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:20.200
Yoshika-chan!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:21.530
Launch!

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:27.040
That's dangerous!
Your magic power is unstable!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.910
It's impossible. She won't be able to fly.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:32.540
Fly like the wind, Miyafuji!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.630
Go, Yoshika!

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:35.920
You're almost there!

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.380
You can do it, Yoshika-chan!

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.340
Girls...

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.430
Remember our training, Miyafuji-san!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.100
Become one with the Striker!

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:52.020
<i>Become one with the Striker...</i>

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:55.770
<i>And with your own strength... Step forward!</i>

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.400
Yoshika-chan!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:10.620
Yes!

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:11.710
She pulled it off!

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:12.580
She did it.

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.210
Incredible, Yoshika-chan.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.800
She never ceases to amaze me.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.220
She's flying.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:30.600
How... How is she able to fly?

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.980
That's just how she is, Minna.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.730
I don't think it's just her.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:39.980
Girls!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.570
Sakamoto-san!

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.300
This is bad. I can't get
close to the Yamato.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.230
What is all this?

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:25.400
Mi-Miyafuji?

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.410
A shield? This couldn't be...

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.210
Escape, Miyafuji!

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.710
Sakamoto-san!

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.630
It's impossible, Miyafuji!
Forget about me!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:40.630
Huh?

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:45.920
The Neuroi is using my magic power to generate a shield.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.180
There's no way you can defeat it!

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.180
There's nothing a Witch can't do!

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:57.980
You're the one who taught me that!

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:00.940
Miyafuji...

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.150
I will never give up!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:08.490
Huh?

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:10.320
Huh?

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:12.660
Yoshika-chan.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.330
You've got us, too.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.410
Guys!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:17.710
Let's go, girls.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.630
Formation Victor.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.590
Cover Miyafuji-san.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.050
Roger!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.840
I believe in you.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.220
Defeat the Neuroi, Miyafuji-san.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.510
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:38.390
Knock it out of the sky, Miyafuji!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:47.110
We'll cut a path for you.
Now go, Miyafuji!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:49.990
I bet you won't even break a sweat.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.740
I'm counting on you, Miyafuji-san.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.410
<i>Tonnerre!</i>

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.710
You'll be fine, Yoshika-chan.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.390
Luck's on your side today, Miyafuji.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.190
Go, Yoshika!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.740
You can do it, Yoshika-chan!

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.260
Reppumaru.

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.060
It won't budge!

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.660
Give me all you've got,
Magnificent Lightning.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:33.840
Miyafuji...

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.800
She got it.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.930
Sakamoto-san!

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:42.890
Stop it, Miyafuji!

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:45.900
Reppumaru will eat up
all your magic power!

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:47.270
I don't care.

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.070
Miyafuji.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.280
If it means I can protect everyone...

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:57.910
If that wish can come true...

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:08.840
I beg you, Reppumaru. I will
give you all my magic power.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:10.550
In return, please,

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:13.090
defeat the Neuroi!

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.090
Let me perform the True Reppuzan!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.780
Miyafuji!

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:35.610
<i>Reppuzan!</i>

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:18.950
The signal from the Neuroi is completely gone.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:21.740
Where are they?

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:27.710
There!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.020
Miyafuji?

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.110
Sakamoto-san!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:58.740
Miyafuji, your magic power...

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:02.530
It's okay. I was able to protect everyone.

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:04.790
My wish came true!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:07.950
I see.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.000
Thank you, Miyafuji.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:15.380
The only problem is that
neither of us can fly.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:22.510
It's okay. There are eleven of us, after all.

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:25.140
Oh, right. That's true.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:28.350
Yoshika-chan!

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:31.480
Miyafuji!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:34.150
Major!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.380
Minna.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:07.350
I followed your order. I'm back.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.810
Welcome back, Mio!

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:20.570
Yes! The Neuroi are gone!

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.950
Romagna is free!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:28.580
Yes! Yes! We won! Yay! Yay!

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.790
Yes!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.790
We did it, Yoshika-chan.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:35.330
Yeah.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:06.320
<i>I exhausted all of my magic power during this battle.</i>

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:10.830
<i>I may no longer be able to fly these blue skies as a Witch...</i>

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:15.920
<i>But I have no regrets.</i>

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:20.420
<i>For I was able to protect
something precious to me.</i>

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:22.960
<i>My wish came true!</i>

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.510
It's over.

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:29.100
Yeah.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:31.310
Mission complete!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:34.180
All Strike Witches, return to base!

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:34.940
Roger!

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:40.270
<i>In July of 1945,</i>

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:44.950
<i>the Neuroi in the Venezian and Romagnan airspace were confirmed destroyed.</i>

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:50.080
<i>This marked the formal disbandment of the 501st Joint Fighter Wing,</i>

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.540
<i>the Strike Witches.</i>

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:44.000
What are you reading?

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:45.090
Nothing.

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:53.930
<i>Our duel will have to wait, Hartmann.</i>

00:22:55.850 --> 00:22:59.390
Protection of Venezia and Romagna,

00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:03.150
has been formally transferred to us, the 504th Joint Fighter Wing.

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:05.030
But of course.

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:08.610
Protecting Romagna should
be left to Romagnans.

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:12.370
I'm pretty sure the 501st
had a Romagnan in it, too.

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:15.870
Enough about that.
Let's go shopping in Rome!

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:18.540
Captain Takei!

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:20.750
You have a letter!

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:22.210
Watch out, Amaki!

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:31.380
Experiment failed.

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:42.310
Yoshika-chan!

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:43.940
Oh, Micchan.

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:46.400
Is the bird okay?

00:23:48.780 --> 00:23:49.740
Yeah.

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:52.490
See, it's fine.

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:53.370
I'm so happy!
